{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790764620, "covers_from": "2026-09-30T10:37:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-30T10:38:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790764680, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-30T10:37:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "queue_number": 54097, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "市政", "content": "台北市停車格越來越少", "display_name": "中山代表 No.54,097", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T10:37:05+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 54098, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北很多道路 原本內線是直行 結果下個路口突然變左轉專用道 造成汽車用路人要切來切去 尖峰很危險", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.54,098", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T10:37:20+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18406, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "以前早上的街道都很乾淨\n現在沿路都會有煙蒂 落葉 蟑螂\n邊走路邊抽菸的人越來越多", "display_name": "大安代表 No.18,406", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T10:37:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24964, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北車站（忠孝）往東那邊，明明是同一個站名卻在不同路口，好幾次因為這樣錯過公車", "display_name": "中正代表 No.24,964", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-30T10:37:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3070, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "教育", "content": "我親愛的市長，現在的孩子念書辛苦，地方媽媽只希望孩子在學校，能吃飽吃好，而不是白飯配肉鬆，剩一堆廚餘", "display_name": "松山代表 Rachel", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 54098, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.54,098", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 18406, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.18,406", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "froz